module

public import Langlandscape.Defect.Setting
public import Mathlib.RingTheory.LocalRing.MaximalIdeal.Defs

/-!
# Hypothesis `TamSpec`: shape and specialisation of the Tamagawa ideal (S06-L8a)

`mathematics/chapters/s06/s06-m2.tex`, `lem:s06-tam` (a)–(c) and the remark after its proof (`𝒪 = 𝒪̃_P`, the
normalisation of `I_F/P`, a DVR): (a) `ρ_F|_{I_q}` is unipotent and `𝔱_q(F)` is generated by the entries of
`ρ_F(τ) - 1` for one `τ ∈ I_q`; (b) `P(𝔱_q(F)) 𝒪̃_P = (ϖ_P^{t_f(q)})`, written uniformiser-free as `𝔪^t` (equal to
`(ϖ^t)` in a DVR); (c) `t_f(q) < ∞` (automatic for `t : ℕ`) and `(ϖ^t) ≠ 0` (`𝒪̃_P` is a DVR, not a field).

Source: Kim–Ota (2019) Def. 2.12, p. 6 (= Pollack–Weston (2006) Def. 3.3, p. 9) for `t_f(q)`; local–global
compatibility at `q` (Carayol Th. (A); DDT Thm 3.1) and uniqueness of the lattice under (H2).
Status: *maths only* (proved modulo cited in `lem:s06-tam`), not formalized. Owner: S06-L8a. Consumer:
`Defect.defect_formula` (S06-L9a, step (5)), `Defect.cor_allweights` (S06-L9b, at `P′` via `Setting.withPoint`).
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace Langlandscape.Hyp

variable {Λ I T 𝒪 G : Type*} [CommRing Λ] [CommRing I] [IsDomain I] [IsNoetherianRing I] [IsLocalRing I]
  [Algebra Λ I] [CommRing T] [Algebra Λ T] [CommRing 𝒪] [IsDomain 𝒪] [IsLocalRing 𝒪] [Algebra I 𝒪] [Group G]

/-- `lem:s06-tam` (`s06-tam`) (a)–(c): every `ρ_F(σ)`, `σ ∈ I_q`, is unipotent; `𝔱_q(F)` is generated by the entries of
`ρ_F(τ) - 1` for one `τ ∈ I_q`; `P(𝔱_q(F)) 𝒪̃_P = 𝔪^{t_f(q)} = (ϖ_P^{t_f(q)})`; and `𝔪^{t_f(q)} ≠ 0`.
Source: [KO, Def. 2.12, p. 6], [PW, Def. 3.3, p. 9], chapter `lem:s06-tam`. Discharge: *maths only*. Owner: S06-L8a. -/
def TamSpec (D : Defect.Setting Λ I T 𝒪 G) : Prop :=
  (∀ σ ∈ D.Iq, ((D.ρ σ : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) I) - 1) ^ 2 = 0) ∧
    (∃ τ ∈ D.Iq, D.tq = Ideal.span
      (Set.range fun ij : Fin 2 × Fin 2 => ((D.ρ τ : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) I) - 1) ij.1 ij.2)) ∧
    D.tq.map D.P = IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal 𝒪 ^ D.t ∧
    IsLocalRing.maximalIdeal 𝒪 ^ D.t ≠ ⊥

end Langlandscape.Hyp
